@ProductsAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7066

### Liste des produits
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products
Accept: application/json

### Un produit
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products/1
Accept: application/json

### Créer un produit (déclenche ProductCreated -> RabbitMQ -> OrdersAPI)
POST {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "prod12",
  "stockQte": 660,
  "price": 1500
}

### Modifier un produit
PUT {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "name": "prod1",
  "stockQte": 50,
  "price": 1000
}

### Supprimer un produit
DELETE {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Products/1
